        <mxCell id="s1" value="OVERVIEW of the detailed pages. Stage 3 (VIP + Host + Happy Hour), controller tests focusedVipPriority and fixtures vip-priority / regular-priority&lt;br/&gt;Starting conditions: C1 Regular seated on turn 1, Happy Hour declined on turns 1-3, C2 VIP arrives on turn 4&lt;br/&gt;Outcome: only C2 pays, bill 648 cents, DEFEAT after turn 18. The Manager choice changes C2 payment turn and satisfaction, not the result" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=12;fillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
